  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Global Pulse - Asia Pacific: Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Global Pulse Asia Pacific (UNGP-AP) is a data innovation facility that supports policymakers in Indonesia and Asia Pacific to use big data and artificial intelligence (AI) to design and implement innovative solutions and evidence-led policy. This investment is the second phase of DFAT&#x2019;s support to UNGP-AP. The program works with the Indonesian National Development Planning Agency (Bappenas) to build GoI&#x2019;s digital capabilities to develop data-driven decision support tools for planning and monitoring of Indonesia&#x2019;s nutritious meal program and mitigating risks of the impact of sea-level rise.</narrative>
  </description>
